# Time Vault: "If you would begin your turn while this artifact is tapped, you may skip that turn instead." (The control is
# time-vault-skips-its-controllers-turn-to-untap-and-takes-an-extra-turn.) Bot1 casts it tapped on turn 1. Bot2's Oko, Thief of Crowns
# makes it a 3/3 Elk with no abilities on turn 2, so turn 3 begins for Bot1 with no offer to skip it, and the Elk, which no longer
# stays tapped, untaps.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Time Vault
Island x3
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Oko, Thief of Crowns
Forest x3
Forest x10

